He's the same artist responsible for the one I remember from the slums.

55
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,120
Hmm.

56
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:08,120
So do you imagine our vandal has some connection to the illustrious Lord Cubitt?

57
